				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				32,
				6
			],
			"Message": "fix(SideCar): Fix cross-drive move on Windows and standardize cache file name\n\n- Renamed `Download.cache` to `Cache.json` for clarity and consistency across the project\n- Replaced manual file moving with `fs_extra::dir::move_dir` to resolve Windows cross-drive move limitations\n- Fixed error handling by converting to `anyhow::Error` using `into()`\n- Adjusted directory creation logic to only create parent directories\n- Updated all documentation references to the new cache file name\n\nThis change ensures reliable installation of sidecar binaries (like Cocoon) on Windows systems where temporary and target directories may reside on different drives. The cache file renaming improves maintainability while the filesystem changes directly support Land's cross-platform requirements for the sidecar management system.",
			"SHA": "68d7853e837345408a999d5eb732bdbeac1dddab"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
